notes.content:
Dear Cultists,

In this patch I bring the following changes:

- End game difficulty reduced a little bit;
- Hero now starts with 20 HP and can reach 23 HP by completing quests;
- Reduced the number of battles to complete the game from 22 to 21;
- Boomerang cast time increased from 1.75 seconds to 2 seconds;
- Fixed a bug a that would cause game to freeze when playing offline or non-administrator mode;
- Fixed a bug that would cause new cards to never show up;
- Reduced number of monsters that have to be defeated to complete Heal and Revenge achievements;

I hope this will increase your enjoyment of the game. 

Stay Evil,

Cthulhu Himself.

